sequenceDiagram
    participant R1 as Reader 1
    participant R2 as Reader 2
    participant M as Readers mutex
    participant S as Resource semaphore
    participant W as Writer

    R1->>M: WaitForSingleObject
    R1->>S: First reader waits/acquires
    Note over R1,S: Semaphore stays acquired while active_readers > 0
    R1->>M: ReleaseMutex
    W->>S: WaitForSingleObject (writer waits)
    R2->>M: WaitForSingleObject
    Note over R2,S: Joins active readers without waiting on the semaphore
    R2->>M: ReleaseMutex
    R1->>M: Decrement active_readers
    R2->>M: Last reader decrements to zero
    R2->>S: ReleaseSemaphore
    W->>S: Acquires exclusive access
    W->>S: ReleaseSemaphore
